@segment  climb-f26-f27
@title    Climb — Focus 26 to Focus 27
@levels   F27
@fixed
@duration ~1m

say Ahead of you in the void, a small white dot appears.
pause 5
say Twenty-six.
pause 4
say It begins to glow. Faintly at first.
pause 5
say It grows brighter. And brighter. And larger, expanding to meet you.
pause 6
level F27
say Twenty-seven.
pause 5
say You enter the light.
pause 10
